                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.21.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "21:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Obwo Elisa akaba ashutami omu nju ye, n'abakuru bashutami hamwe nawe. Omugabe yaamutumaho entumwa omu bu yaabaire aine; kwonka egyo ntumwa ku yaabaire etakahikireyo, Elisa yaagira abo bakuru ati: Nimureeba oku ogwo mwitsi yaatuma kucwaho omutwe? Mbwenu egyo ntumwa ku eraije, mukingye orwigi, murugumyeho engaro, erekye kutaahamu. Emitsindo ya mukama we temuri enyima? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku yaabaire naakigamba nabo, omugabe yaashuuma, yaamuhikaho, yaagira ati: Ezi naku zirugire ahari MUKAMA. Mbwenu nkimwiniireho ki amatsiko?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.33"
            ]
          }
        }
